<h1>New starter onboarding</h1>

<p>Your first day starts with reception at your site, listed in the <a href="/help/directory">staff directory</a>, where you will be issued a site pass and shown to your induction meeting. Health and safety induction is mandatory for all new starters before entering the foundry or machine shop floor, regardless of role.</p>

<p>IT accounts and email access are normally set up before your start date, provided your manager submitted the request in time. If your account is not ready, contact the IT service desk on the extension listed in the directory. Laptop, phone or workshop equipment not already provided can be requested through our <a href="/help/equipment">equipment requests</a> page.</p>

<p>Most new starters complete a two-week induction covering their department, an overview of the site, and an introduction to our quality system; see <a href="/quality">quality management</a> for background reading ahead of that session.</p>
